{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（14日）早上8時10分，警方接獲職員報案指，觀塘游泳池一名女子疑在游泳期間遇溺，救生員遂將她救起。68歲姓甄女泳客昏迷不醒，經由救護車送往聯合醫院搶救。經調查後，警方列案件列作有人暈倒事件調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"觀塘游泳池一名60多歲女泳客被發現昏迷不醒，懷疑遇溺。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198209280805834752845632.jpeg/6Zo5buR6ThIErzDGvH1U67yo_XaLGisrnSstB7crLQc\"/><figcaption>觀塘游泳池一名60多歲女泳客被發現昏迷不醒，懷疑遇溺。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"觀塘游泳池一名60多歲女泳客被發現昏迷不醒，懷疑遇溺。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198209275617349632068153.jpeg/jY1EqtTLpT4kae2ggGlJPM_Xs0A2ERogtQCBSJ8AgUg\"/><figcaption>觀塘游泳池一名60多歲女泳客被發現昏迷不醒，懷疑遇溺。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主昏迷送往聯合醫院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250918/1045222967677554688765023.jpeg/mBADuQcjJxg6gE8ay-_bwjqp2cjwjsRzpEeVtJ5HlbQ\"/><figcaption>事主昏迷送往聯合醫院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:28.179936+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T00:43:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:15:00.004280+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:15:00.004280+00:00","content_hash":"932917546b05781a39f95a4939b8cba43f6d28711fc127f9589d63cb45482c03","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}